    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities and powerups to defeat enemies, avoid traps, collect gems, and score enough points to summon bosses. Defeat these bosses to complete stages and open rifts to randomized biomes. Collect upgrades between stages to make sure you can survive. In this endless arcade-style roguelike, how many points can you get?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of abilities to attack either one or multiple enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/08be5a2f91d14201efd4ca6a6556e73d.poster.avif?t=1751409268\" width=694 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/08be5a2f91d14201efd4ca6a6556e73d.webm?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/08be5a2f91d14201efd4ca6a6556e73d.mp4?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take advantage of your abilities and how the environment affects your enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/a406d962286feb804f589d766f7712c8.poster.avif?t=1751409268\" width=692 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/a406d962286feb804f589d766f7712c8.webm?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/a406d962286feb804f589d766f7712c8.mp4?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never lose track of yourself or your enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/96ea974633ff2ee35b55faca170eeb4a.poster.avif?t=1751409268\" width=694 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/96ea974633ff2ee35b55faca170eeb4a.webm?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611180/extras/96ea974633ff2ee35b55faca170eeb4a.mp4?t=1751409268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
